      "id": "mbnLJKeBINTYh7q_dtOWe",
      "x": -1641,
      "y": -50.5,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 187.5,
      "text": "GET  /api/exercises?muscle=&q=      search exercise library\nGET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/plans[/:id]  workout plans + their exercises\nGET/POST /api/schedule               assign plans to dates / weekdays\nPOST /api/logs                        record session + sets + RPE/fatigue\nGET  /api/stats/me                    muscle volume, leg days, fatigue trend\nGET  /api/suggestions                 neglected muscle groups \u2192 exercises\nPOST /api/friends/:username           send request;  PUT accept\nGET  /api/feed                        friends' recent logs + posts\nPOST /api/posts                       caption + photo upload\nGET  /api/users/:username             public profile, heat map, stats",
      "originalText": "GET  /api/exercises?muscle=&q=      search exercise library\nGET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/plans[/:id]  workout plans + their exercises\nGET/POST /api/schedule               assign plans to dates / weekdays\nPOST /api/logs                        record session + sets + RPE/fatigue\nGET  /api/stats/me                    muscle volume, leg days, fatigue trend\nGET  /api/suggestions                 neglected muscle groups \u2192 exercises\nPOST /api/friends/:username           send request;  PUT accept\nGET  /api/feed                        friends' recent logs + posts\nPOST /api/posts                       caption + photo upload\nGET  /api/users/:username             public profile, heat map, stats",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
