      "type": "text",
      "id": "N4MfDCReMoD8aGZnrYAe9",
      "x": -1625,
      "y": 230.5,
      "width": 874.5000000000001,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "\u2022 App name (LiftLog?)  \u2022 Which exercise API (wger is free, no key)  \u2022 Hosting provider + where photos live\n\u2022 Suggestions: rule-based (least-trained muscle group in last 14 days) vs. LLM call\n\u2022 Profile privacy: friends-only vs. public  \u2022 Who owns which phase (split by team member)\n\u2022 Testing: add a real test script (currently npm test is a stub)",
      "originalText": "\u2022 App name (LiftLog?)  \u2022 Which exercise API (wger is free, no key)  \u2022 Hosting provider + where photos live\n\u2022 Suggestions: rule-based (least-trained muscle group in last 14 days) vs. LLM call\n\u2022 Profile privacy: friends-only vs. public  \u2022 Who owns which phase (split by team member)\n\u2022 Testing: add a real test script (currently npm test is a stub)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
